# Archived session transcripts are machine-written records, not source.
#
# -diff        never attempt a textual diff; a 43 MB single-line-per-record JSONL produces
#              a diff nobody can read and slows every `git log -p` in the repository.
# -merge       there is no sensible merge of two append-only transcripts.
# linguist-generated  keep them out of GitHub's language statistics and collapse them by
#              default in pull requests.
docs/log/**/session-raw.jsonl   -diff -merge linguist-generated
